{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "9d0f4c2a8b6e1735",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 2620,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n# Multivariate regression · Several responses\n\nFollow the mean model, error assumptions, estimation, residual sampling laws, and interpretation. Here several responses share predictors. Colours identify roles in this map.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n# 多元线性回归 · 多响应模型\n\n从真正的概念定义开始，再分开预设假设、误差模型、点估计、残差抽样律和解释边界。这里的 multivariate regression 指多个响应共享一组预测变量，不是单响应的 multiple regression。\n\n颜色只区分本图中的语义角色，不表示掌握程度。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "a41e9c73d25b680f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 990,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 540,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[多响应线性回归|Multivariate linear regression]]\n$Y_{n\\times q}=X_{n\\times k}B_{k\\times q}+U$.\nThere are $n$ observations, $q$ responses, and $k$ design columns. With $\\mathbb E[U\\mid X]=0$, $XB$ is the conditional mean; $U$ is the model error, not a fitted residual.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[多响应线性回归]]\n同一设计矩阵建模多个响应的条件均值。$n$ 是观测数，$q$ 是响应数，$k$ 是设计列数；零条件均值使 $XB$ 表示均值。$U$ 是模型误差，不是拟合残差。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "b52fa18c4d3079e6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1410,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 480,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[多响应与多解释变量回归|Several responses or several predictors?]]\nSeveral predictors do not imply several responses. Check whether $Y$ has one response column or $q>1$ columns; the two models can share a Chinese name.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[多响应与多解释变量回归]]\n多个预测变量不等于多个响应。先看 $Y$ 是 $n\\times1$ 还是 $n\\times q$，不要被中文“多元回归”的同名用法带偏。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "c63ab29d5e4180f7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 840,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 480,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[多响应一般线性假设|State the joint hypothesis]]\nIn $H_0:CBA=D$, $C$ selects coefficient directions, $A$ response combinations, and $D$ the null values. Use estimable restrictions. Hypothesis and error SSPs must refer to the same response space: $E_A=A^TE_{SSP}A$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[多响应一般线性假设]]\n$C$ 选系数方向，$A$ 选响应组合，$D$ 给出假设值。限制必须可估，假设与误差 SSP 必须位于同一响应空间：$E_A=A^TE_{SSP}A$。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "d74bc3ae6f529108",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1620,
      "y": 1420,
      "width": 370,
      "height": 480,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[矩阵正态误差结构|Matrix-normal errors]]\nFor fixed $X$, $Y\\sim MN(XB,\\Omega,\\Sigma)$ is a joint Gaussian model. $\\Omega$ is the row factor and $\\Sigma$ the response factor. Stacking columns gives $\\operatorname{Cov}(\\operatorname{vec}U)=\\Sigma\\otimes\\Omega$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[矩阵正态误差结构]]\n固定 $X$ 后，矩阵正态模型同时规定 Gaussian 分布和可分协方差。$\\Omega$ 管观测行方向，$\\Sigma$ 管响应方向；按列堆叠后为 $\\Sigma\\otimes\\Omega$。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "e85cd4bf7053a219",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1830,
      "y": 840,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 540,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[观测行协方差|Covariance across rows]]\nFor zero-mean error rows written as columns $u_i$, the separable model is $\\operatorname{Cov}(u_i,u_j)=\\Omega_{ij}\\Sigma$. Thus $\\Omega_{ij}$ is a factor, not the whole covariance block. $\\Omega=I_n$ gives uncorrelated rows; joint Gaussianity also gives independence.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[观测行协方差]]\n$\\Omega_{ij}$ 要乘响应因子 $\\Sigma$ 才得到行间协方差块。单位阵、异方差对角阵、带非零非对角元的矩阵是不同假设；单凭不相关不能保证独立；联合 Gaussian 条件下可以。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "f96de5c08164b32a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2040,
      "y": 1420,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 480,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[相关行不容独立推断|Inference with dependent rows]]\nA zero conditional error mean preserves conditional OLS unbiasedness under a full-column-rank fixed design; it does not imply consistency. Dependent errors need their own standard-error and residual-law justification.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[相关行不容独立推断]]\n固定满列秩设计下，零条件误差均值保留 OLS 条件无偏性，却不自动给出一致性。误差依赖时，标准误与残差参考分布需要分别核对。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "0a7ef6d19275c43b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 990,
      "y": 840,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 480,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[共享设计的逐响应OLS|OLS one response at a time]]\nCommon rows and $X$, unweighted squared loss, and unconstrained coefficient columns let the objective split by response. If $X$ has full column rank, $\\hat B=(X^TX)^{-1}X^TY$. Response correlation still matters for joint inference.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[共享设计的逐响应OLS]]\n共享行与设计、普通平方损失、无跨响应系数约束时，按列求 OLS 即可；满列秩保证上述系数唯一。响应相关性仍影响联合不确定性。",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "1b8f07e2a386d54c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2250,
      "y": 840,
      "width": 370,
      "height": 540,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[相关行下的多响应GLS|GLS with a known row factor]]\nUnder separable covariance, known $\\Omega\\succ0$, $\\Sigma\\succ0$, and full-column-rank $X$, GLS uses the same $\\Omega^{-1}$ weighting for every response. $\\Omega=cI_n$ ($c>0$) suffices for OLS equality; it is not necessary for every design.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[相关行下的多响应GLS]]\n在上述可分协方差与满列秩条件下，各响应共用行加权。$\\Omega$ 为正数乘单位阵足以得到 OLS；某些其他 $\\Omega$ 与设计搭配也会相同。",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "2c9018f3b497e65d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 990,
      "y": 1420,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 480,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[多响应残差与误差SSP|Residuals and their SSP]]\n$R=Y-X\\hat B$ is $n\\times q$ and retains observations. $E_{SSP}=R^TR$ is $q\\times q$ and retains response cross-products. These are computed after fitting; $U$ is the error relative to the model mean. Both fitted objects come from the same residual space.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[多响应残差与误差SSP]]\n$R$ 保留逐观测拟合偏差，$E_{SSP}$ 压缩成响应方向平方和与交叉乘积。二者共享残差空间；不是因为矩阵尺寸不同就各有另一套残差自由度。",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "3da12904c5a8f76e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 780,
      "y": 2000,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 540,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[误差SSP抽样律|The residual Wishart law]]\nFor fixed $X$ and correct mean $XB$, iid model-error rows $N_q(0,\\Sigma)$ with $\\Sigma\\succ0$ give $E_{SSP}\\sim W_q(\\Sigma,\\nu)$, $\\nu=n-\\operatorname{rank}X>0$. Fitted residual rows need not be independent. If $\\nu=0$, $E_{SSP}=0$. For $\\nu>0$, divide by $\\nu$ for an unbiased covariance estimate; the internal Gaussian covariance MLE divides by $n$ only if $E_{SSP}\\succ0$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[误差SSP抽样律]]\n独立 Gaussian 的是零均值模型误差行；拟合残差行一般不独立。$\\nu>0$ 时无偏估计为 $E_{SSP}/\\nu$；内部 Gaussian 协方差 MLE 要求 $E_{SSP}$ 正定，才取 $E_{SSP}/n$。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "4eb23a15d6b9087f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 2000,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 480,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[误差SSP秩边界|Residual rank limits]]\nLet $r=\\operatorname{rank}X$, $\\nu=n-r$, and $q$ be the response count. For ordinary least squares,\n$\\operatorname{rank}(E_{SSP})=\\operatorname{rank}(R)\\le\\min(q,\\nu)$.\n$q>\\nu$ forces singularity; $q\\le\\nu$ only permits full rank.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[误差SSP秩边界]]\n$r$ 是设计秩，$\\nu$ 是残差自由度。响应数超过 $\\nu$ 必奇异；不超过也可能奇异。即使能求逆，估计也可能不稳定。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "5fc34b26e7ca1980",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2040,
      "y": 2000,
      "width": 370,
      "height": 480,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[聚类标准误边界|Cluster-robust inference]]\n\nChoose the level from sampling, assignment and dependence. Standard one-way theory allows within-cluster dependence but relies on many conditionally independent clusters and regularity conditions. Few or dominant clusters need special care; arbitrary cross-cluster dependence is not covered.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[聚类标准误边界]]\n按抽样、分配与依赖机制选层级。常规单向聚类理论允许簇内依赖，但需大量在给定设计后独立的簇及正则条件。少簇或主导簇要另查；它不允许任意跨簇依赖。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "60d45c37f8db2a91",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1420,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 480,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[多响应联合显著边界|What a joint rejection means]]\n\nA valid rejection gives evidence against the prespecified joint null. It neither proves a particular response differs nor establishes significance for every response. Defined follow-up comparisons need appropriate multiplicity control.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[多响应联合显著边界]]\n总体拒绝是反对预设联合零假设的证据，不证明某个响应必然不同，也不能推出每个响应显著。明确后续比较对象，再采用合适的多重性控制。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "71e56d4809ec3ba2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2000,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 480,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[多响应因果边界|Causal interpretation]]\n\nAssociation coefficients may differ from intervention effects. Define the intervention and population, justify causal identification, and check the test calibration. A multivariate model or a small joint p-value supplies no automatic identification.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[多响应因果边界]]\n关联的系数可能不同于干预效应。先定义干预和总体，说明因果识别依据，再检查检验校准；多响应形式或很小的联合 p 值都不会自动识别因果。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "82f67e591afd4cb3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 1420,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 480,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[响应尺度与线性变换|Response units and coordinates]]\nFor invertible $T$, $Y^*=YT$ and $B^*=BT$. Keep the same $CBA=D$ question by using $A^*=T^{-1}A$. Estimable contrasts retain their SSPs; full-space criteria agree when defined. Reduction and penalties need separate checks.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[响应尺度与线性变换]]\n可逆换坐标后，用 $A^*=T^{-1}A$ 保留原问题。可估对比的 SSP 不变；完整空间统计量在有定义时一致。降维与惩罚另查。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "93a78f6a2b0e5dc4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 710,
      "y": 2600,
      "width": 780,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "## 相邻体系\n\n- 单响应估计与系数解释：[[OLS 线性回归.canvas|OLS 线性回归]]\n- 多响应联合检验：[[MANOVA 多元方差分析.canvas|MANOVA]]\n- 均值向量检验：[[Hotelling T² 与多元均值推断.canvas|Hotelling T²]]\n- 误差 SSP 的抽样律与秩：[[Wishart 分布与样本协方差推断.canvas|Wishart]]\n- 重复测量与面板依赖：[[面板数据：Pooled OLS、固定效应与随机效应.canvas|面板数据]]\n- 响应降维与尺度：[[主成分分析.canvas|PCA]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084nullhyp0001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 480,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[零假设与备择假设|Null and alternative hypotheses]]\n$H_0$ states a reference claim about the population; $H_1$ states the departure of interest. “Both coefficients are zero” has alternative “at least one is nonzero.” A decision is evidence under the model, not a proof.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[零假设与备择假设]]\n先明确总体问题。两个系数都为零的备择是至少一个非零；拒绝或不拒绝都不是逻辑证明。"
    }
  ],
